From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 16:45:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] T71 F5: the window binds the set, the title block has a
 home, two PRO files licensed
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

projectStore: setTitleBlock merges the title block's words onto the project and
remembers the company (name, tagline, lines) on this computer for the next job.
DrawingModal: hands the set the design layer's worktops and the scene's render
(captured through the Output ▸ Render rig, three-quarter left, at the visualisation
frame's aspect), carries the title block's fields, walks the numbered sheets, hides
the paper choice for the set, names the extra section station.
ConfiguratorPage: <DrawingModal rig={renderRig} />; the menu path binds the same set
with the same worktops and render. outputMenu: "Drawing set (PDF)" and "Drawing set
(DXF)", ids unchanged.
Freeze: DrawingModal.jsx and ConfiguratorPage.jsx licensed in the T59 EXEMPT map with
the owner's words and re-frozen at their new hashes; the T69 F9 count assertion
re-pinned to the named list.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UMSCbqdi85whfyRQS2gqQ2
